WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:11.660
Open the form for a new sales records board.

2
00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:19.260
Review the board name and purpose, then return to the existing board.

3
00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:33.540
Open the existing board and its field settings.

4
00:00:33.580 --> 00:00:39.660
Each sales field has a name and a data type.

5
00:00:47.380 --> 00:01:04.140
Open CSV import to bring sales records into the board.

6
00:01:04.180 --> 00:01:12.180
The import wizard selects the sales board.

7
00:01:12.220 --> 00:01:21.220
Map each CSV column to its matching board field.

8
00:01:21.260 --> 00:01:29.900
Review the import confirmation, then return to the existing records.

9
00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:36.260
The fictional sales records keep revenue, cost and margin together.

10
00:01:42.340 --> 00:01:49.500
Open the workflow template import dialog.

11
00:01:49.540 --> 00:01:56.540
The dialog checks the selected file before import.

12
00:01:56.580 --> 00:02:01.820
This import route asks for a FlowOps template file.

13
00:02:01.820 --> 00:02:12.620
Review the prepared template, then return to the existing workflow.

14
00:02:20.100 --> 00:02:29.460
The workflow reads the board and returns its records as JSON.

15
00:02:29.460 --> 00:02:36.420
Flow Settings connects the workflow to the analyst.

16
00:02:36.460 --> 00:02:41.400
The workflow accepts a question through its POST method.

17
00:02:48.100 --> 00:03:17.020
Explore the form for a general agent.

18
00:03:17.020 --> 00:03:27.060
Review the analyst name and description, then open the existing analyst.

19
00:03:51.300 --> 00:04:01.940
The existing analyst shows its selected model and provider.

20
00:04:10.020 --> 00:04:19.180
The core instructions connect the analyst to its sales workflow.

21
00:04:25.980 --> 00:04:36.140
The analyst uses its workflow to read the sales board.

22
00:04:43.220 --> 00:04:51.860
Chart support is enabled in the analyst settings.

23
00:05:46.380 --> 00:06:04.140
Choose the sales analyst in the chat workspace.

24
00:06:04.140 --> 00:06:08.460
The selected analyst is ready for a sales question.

25
00:06:08.460 --> 00:06:37.020
Ask for East gross margin in a fresh conversation.

26
00:06:37.020 --> 00:06:47.100
The answer gives East margin, its percentage and the revenue behind it.

27
00:06:47.140 --> 00:07:41.260
The completed tool card links the answer to the sales workflow.

28
00:07:54.140 --> 00:08:03.100
Compare the answer with East revenue and margin on the source board.
